---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Journeys by Jaz"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Journeys by Jaz collects, uses, shares and protects your personal information when you use our website, contact us or request vacation planning services."
  path="/privacy-policy"
  updated="2026-11-18"
>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Journeys by Jaz</strong> (“Journeys by Jaz,” “we,” “us” or “our”) collects, uses, shares and protects personal information when you visit <a href="https://journeysbyjaz.com">journeysbyjaz.com</a>, contact us, or request vacation planning services. By using our website or services, you agree to this policy.</p>

  <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
  <p>Journeys by Jaz is an independent travel advisor and vacation planner serving Houston-area travelers and clients across the United States. We are affiliated with Enchanted Escapes Travel (Enchanted Escapes, LLC), an Authorized Disney Vacation Planner agency in Cypress, Texas, through which travel bookings are made. Florida Seller of Travel #ST40359.</p>

  <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you fill out our travel list or planning form, call, text or email us, we may collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact details: name, email address, phone number, and city or state.</li>
    <li>Trip details: travel dates, budget, destination and vacation type, group size, and the ages of children traveling.</li>
    <li>Booking information needed by travel suppliers, such as the names of travelers as they appear on identification, dates of birth, and special requests (for example, accessibility or dietary needs).</li>
    <li>Messages and notes from our conversations with you.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Payment information.</strong> We do not collect or store your payment card numbers on this website. Travel payments are made directly to the travel supplier (such as Disney, a cruise line or a resort) through their systems or the secure Enchanted Escapes Travel booking form. Our $35 planning fee is processed by a payment provider; we do not see your full card number.</p>
  <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting and security provider (Cloudflare) may process technical data such as your IP address, browser type, device type, pages requested and timestamps, in order to deliver the site, protect it from attacks and keep it running. We do not use advertising trackers on this website.</p>

  <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your questions and requests.</li>
    <li>To research and prepare vacation options, quotes and itineraries for you.</li>
    <li>To book travel you have chosen, and to stay in touch before, during and after your trip.</li>
    <li>To send service messages, such as confirmations, payment reminders and trip updates.</li>
    <li>To send occasional travel tips or offers, if you have agreed to receive them. You can opt out at any time.</li>
    <li>To keep our website secure, prevent fraud and meet legal and accounting obligations.</li>
    <li>To improve our website and services.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. How we share your information</h2>
  <p><strong>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it for third-party advertising.</strong> We share information only when needed to provide our services:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Travel suppliers and booking partners</strong>, such as Disney, cruise lines, resorts, tour operators and insurance providers, and our affiliated agency Enchanted Escapes Travel, so that your trip can be quoted, booked and managed.</li>
    <li><strong>Service providers</strong> that help us run our business, such as our customer-relationship and form platform (GoHighLevel / LeadConnector), email and text delivery services (including Mailgun), and website hosting and security (Cloudflare). They may only use your information to provide services to us.</li>
    <li><strong>Legal and safety reasons</strong>, when required by law, court order or government request, or to protect the rights, property or safety of our clients, us or others.</li>
    <li><strong>Business changes</strong>, if our business is sold or reorganized, in which case your information may be transferred under this policy.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Text-message opt-in data and consent are not shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</p>

  <h2>5. Email and text messages</h2>
  <p>If you provide your email address or phone number, we may contact you about your inquiry or trip. If you choose to receive marketing emails or text messages, you can opt out at any time: use the unsubscribe link in any email, reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any text message, or contact us. Message and data rates may apply. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help. We will still send non-promotional messages related to a trip you have booked.</p>

  <h2>6. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
  <p>This website does not set advertising or tracking cookies. Our forms and booking pages are hosted by third-party providers (such as GoHighLevel and Enchanted Escapes Travel) who may use cookies or similar technologies that are necessary for those pages to work. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

  <h2>7. How long we keep information</h2>
  <p>We keep personal information only as long as needed for the purposes described in this policy, including to provide your travel services, keep business and tax records, resolve disputes and meet legal requirements. When information is no longer needed, we delete or de-identify it.</p>

  <h2>8. How we protect information</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical and organizational safeguards, including encrypted connections (HTTPS) and access controls on the systems we use. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security. Please avoid sending sensitive information, such as full payment card numbers, passport numbers or Social Security numbers, by regular email or text.</p>

  <h2>9. Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>You may ask us to access, correct or delete your personal information, or to stop sending you marketing messages. Depending on where you live (for example, Texas, California and other U.S. states), you may have additional privacy rights, such as the right to know what personal information we hold, to request deletion or correction, and to not be discriminated against for exercising your rights. We do not sell personal information. To make a request, email us at <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. We may need to verify your identity before responding, and we may keep information we are legally required to retain.</p>

  <h2>10. Children’s privacy</h2>
  <p>Our website and services are directed to adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children under 13. Parents and guardians may give us information about children traveling with them (such as ages or names for bookings). If you believe a child has given us personal information without parental consent, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

  <h2>11. Third-party links and services</h2>
  <p>Our website may link to other websites, such as travel suppliers and our form and booking pages. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of other sites. Please read their privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>12. Where your information is processed</h2>
  <p>We are based in the United States, and our service providers may process information in the United States and other countries where they operate. We take steps to ensure providers handle information appropriately.</p>

  <h2>13. Do Not Track</h2>
  <p>Because we do not track you across websites for advertising, we do not respond differently to browser “Do Not Track” signals.</p>

  <h2>14. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will change the “Last updated” date at the top of this page. Continued use of our website or services after an update means you accept the revised policy.</p>

  <h2>15. Contact us</h2>
  <p>For questions or requests about this policy or your personal information, email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> or call <a href="tel:+17138870363">(713) 887-0363</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
